---
// The apps that are built, as cards with a small picture.
---

<section class="band" id="apps">
  <h2>The daily work, without SSH.</h2>
  <p class="sub">Each app opens in its own window. Move them, resize them, and keep several open at once.</p>
  <div class="bento">
    <article class="card wide">
      <div class="art a-files" aria-hidden="true">
        <span><i class="dir"></i>sites-enabled<em>12 Nov</em></span>
        <span><i></i>nginx.conf<em>2.4 KB</em></span>
        <span class="up"><i></i>backup-2026-11.tar<em>uploading</em><b></b></span>
        <span><i></i>mime.types<em>5.3 KB</em></span>
      </div>
      <h3>Files</h3>
      <p>Browse the whole disk. Upload large files in parts that resume after a network fault. Copy, move, rename, delete to a trash, make zip archives, change owners and permissions. Look at pictures, video and PDF files without a download.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="art a-term" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="ps">admin@server:~$</span>
        <span class="type">systemctl restart nginx</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Terminal</h3>
      <p>A real shell on the server. Reload the page and the same shell is still there.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="art a-code" aria-hidden="true">
        <span><u>server</u> {'{'}</span>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>listen</u> <b>443</b> ssl;</span>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>server_name</u> <b>example.org</b>;</span>
        <span>{'}'}</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Editor</h3>
      <p>Edit config files with syntax colours. A save never overwrites a change someone else made.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="art a-search" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="keys"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><kbd>K</kbd></span>
        <span class="hit">nginx.conf</span>
        <span>Terminal</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Search</h3>
      <p>Find an app, a file or a folder by name from anywhere.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="art a-log" aria-hidden="true">
        <span><i></i>file.save<em>/etc/nginx/nginx.conf</em></span>
        <span><i></i>terminal.open<em>admin</em></span>
        <span class="bad"><i></i>session.create<em>refused</em></span>
      </div>
      <h3>Activity</h3>
      <p>A list of every change: who did it, from which address, when, and if it was refused.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
